00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.680
Are you trying to get me to wear my uniform again too?

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:25.480
Tearju-sensei wants to be able to 
talk to you like she could in the past.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:28.190
I think you should at least know that.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.700
Of course I know that.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.700
But... Yuuki Rito.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:43.750
What if I told Mikan that you wear her panties on your face
every night and call yourself "The Mysterious Shameless Mask"?

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:48.170
Do you think you would be able to speak to her normally like you have until now?

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.800
What kind of example is that...?

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:54.050
And an assassin like myself is worse than that kind of pervert.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:58.390
I've fallen so far as to become known as the infamous Golden Darkness.

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:02.060
How can I just put that aside and get along with Tear?

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.350
Yami! But, you said it yourself, didn't you?

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:08.070
You said that to you, Tear was like family.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:08.820
Yes.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:15.660
All the more reason why I, who have lost
my way, have no right to make up with Tear.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:17.410
Yami...

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:25.500
It seems Rito-san is having difficulty convincing her, as well.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.840
W-We don't know that yet.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.170
What is it?

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:33.180
Actually, why are you here too, Oshizu-san?

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:35.640
I heard about it from Mikan-san...

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:38.600
Well, I was searching for Yami-san as well.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.770
Then I got chased by a dog,

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.060
and I ended up hiding here by coincidence.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:45.810
I-Is that so?

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:48.230
But why were you searching for Yami-san?

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.480
For the same reason as Rito-san and you.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:54.650
Because I want Tear-sensei and Yami-san to get along well.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.070
Oshizu-san...

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:59.160
That's enough, Yuuki Rito.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:03.750
Don't interject yourself into my family problems any further.

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.290
But, Yami...!

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:09.790
Then I can interject myself because I'm part of the family, right?

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:12.340
Mea!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:16.090
Mea...

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.220
Is she intending to interfere with Rito-san?!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.140
This is bad!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.520
Oshizu-san, wait.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.100
Momo-san, why?!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:34.490
Yami-oneechan, until now I've lived according to Master's orders.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:38.490
That was the correct thing to do, and I was able to feel at ease.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:41.790
I couldn't help but feel anxious because I didn't have any orders.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:49.500
But... recently I've been thinking acting
according to your own will is not so bad, either.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:52.090
Now I understand.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:57.380
I understand that you're afraid of moving forward, Yami-oneechan.

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:02.060
It's the same as when I was fighting with Nana-chan.

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:03.560
But...

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:08.140
If you don't face each other,

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:09.940
you'll never make amends with each other.

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:16.700
Senpai made a fuss about that to me.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.360
He's so meddlesome. It really is a pain, isn't it?

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:25.950
Why did I come to say something like this?

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.420
Mea-san...

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:36.720
Maybe I was overly guarded against Mea-san...

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:42.850
The darkness I saw deep in Mea-san's heart...

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.970
What in the world was that Mea-san...?

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:49.980
Huh?

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:50.850
Eh?!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.240
My tail is moving on its own!

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:14.840
Rito-san! Oshizu-san's telekinesis is...!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:14.840
Momo?!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:35.440
Ah! Hey, Senpai!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.740
R-Rito-san...

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:49.540
I hate perverted things!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.910
Rito-san!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:57.420
No!

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:05.850
Welcome home!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:07.600
Oh, Yami-san!

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.470
I'm so glad!

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:12.390
Rito made sure to bring you here, Yami-san.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.190
Wait... what's with his face?!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.820
Oh, Mea!

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:19.230
Good evening, Nana-chan!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:23.610
Mikan, is there anything to drink?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.950
There's some cold barley tea in the refrigerator.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:28.280
Okay. Thanks.

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:29.120
Yami-san!

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.200
Come on in!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.790
Mikan...

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.040
Let's have dinner together!

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:43.550
You really are meddlesome people.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:58.360
Good morning, everyone.

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:06.910
We'll start homeroom now.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:10.120
I'll start with school contact information...

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:11.750
Huh?

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:25.260
I'm late.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:39.230
Thank you.

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:48.410
My little sister is taking a step forward, so I can't lag behind.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:14.220
<b>niwasaki yureru hana ga tsun to senobi de kotaeru</b>

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:14.220
<b>庭先揺れる花がツンと背伸びで応える</b>

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:14.220
<b>The flower swaying in the garden answers by stretching up</b>

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:19.850
<b>tsumasakidachi de asa ni ohayou no kisu</b>

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:19.850
<b>つま先立ちで朝におはようのKiss</b>

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:19.850
<b>To give a good morning kiss standing on tiptoes</b>

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:22.770
<b>saa yukou</b>

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:22.770
<b>さあ行こう</b>

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:22.770
<b>Now let's go!</b>

00:22:22.530 --> 00:22:29.570
<b>fui ni tsumujikaze omowazu shagamikomu</b>

00:22:22.530 --> 00:22:29.570
<b>不意につむじ風思わずしゃがみ込む</b>

00:22:22.530 --> 00:22:29.570
<b>Caught off guard by the sudden whirlwind, I reflexively crouch down</b>

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:41.870
<b>fuwari sukaato ni kakushita yowasatsuyoku haratte miseta</b>

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:41.870
<b>ふわりスカートに隠した弱さ 強く払ってみせた</b>

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:41.870
<b>I firmly brush off the weakness hidden inside my skirt</b>

00:22:42.760 --> 00:22:50.920
<b>fuzoroi de sainan na nichijou ni sakihokorou</b>

00:22:42.760 --> 00:22:50.920
<b>不揃いで災難な日常に咲き誇ろう</b>

00:22:42.760 --> 00:22:50.920
<b>Let's bloom to our fullest in this strange everyday life full of misfortune</b>

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:59.100
<b>sunao ni sodatanai kara chanto mitenakucha</b>

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:59.100
<b>素直に育たないからちゃんと見てなくちゃ</b>

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:59.100
<b>I can't be honest, so you have to pay close attention</b>

00:22:58.860 --> 00:23:07.110
<b>tameratta ano omoi sotto tsuchi ni umetanda</b>

00:22:58.860 --> 00:23:07.110
<b>躊躇ったあの想いそっと土に埋めたんだ</b>

00:22:58.860 --> 00:23:07.110
<b>I carefully buried the memory of my hesitance in the soil</b>

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:13.360
<b>A flower blooming in your heart</b>

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:18.660
<b>sono hi o yume mite</b>

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:18.660
<b>その日を夢見て</b>

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:18.660
<b>I dream of that day</b>

